                                                "sense_id": "e5664abb-72bc-3c07-a255-0badb0551d7f",
                                                "text": "The carbon-fiber microdrone — which weighs just more than two pounds, flies 25 miles an hour and can soar to 3,000 feet — has been used in mountain rescues in Switzerland and for military surveillance by the German army, said Mr. Meyer, president of the company’s United States subsidiary, based in New York."
